#-    §5✐ Authors Note ✐
§d****************************§

§8Have you ever had a dream, then woke up & started your day, only to wake up a 2nd time cause you were still dreaming? That's what this feels like. Where does the previous story end & this story start? Or are they the same...
§7§sStarSweetpea x
#- §6╔═◦♣◦════════╗
          §5Infinite 
       Possibilities!
§6╚════════◦♣◦═╝§8As if my life couldn’t get any… BETTER! ☺ 

I’ve landed my dream job! Praise Fern above! For everything she has given me 
in my beautiful life...

I’m eternally grateful.
#- §8Ever since I was a young seedling, I’ve been fascinated by the paranormal and supernatural. As a Witch and a Flower Maiden I have a very close connection to this land and the energies that entangle themselves deep in the ground, high in the sky, and all things in between.
#- §8My home in Craftadia has it’s unfair 
share of strange phenomena, and I’ve spent many years devoted to helping those in need using my magical abilities and expertise. Recently I was contacted by an enthusiastic CEO who calls herself; 

§0MissPortinari. 
#- §8She pitched me a peculiar idea of joining forces, of creating a team whose §msoul§r sole purpose will §8be investigating these issues using a combination of magic and scientific methods. 
I’ll be stationed on an island in the middle of nowhere named §5Deathcap™
#- §8This place has extreme levels of activity! She also briefly introduced me to a strange woman named §2Dr. Link§8, who is brilliant but really gives me the creeps.

As a magical being it’s a little unorthodox to be using scientific technology, but not unheard of. 
#- §8But with the perfect sales pitch and my secret admiration for science (and not to mention an excellent benefits package) I decided to take a leap of faith and agreed to join the team on this venture.

I’m excited to learn more and develop my abilities even further. 
#- §8To see the unseen, dive into the unknown and unlock the knowledge hidden inside. It’s unusual work, but someone has to do it, and all my life
I’ve felt like that someone... was always going to be me. 

§dThe island 
calls out to me...
#- §8I have so many ideas swimming around my endless ocean of a mind. I plan to document my story 
as it unfolds. 

Infinite possibilities await! §7*happy squeek*

§8Although, that giant 'sinkhole' looks like it could cause some problems...
#- §8I'm sure it's nothing I can't handle. I'm just... so... lucky you know!? 
I don't know what I did in a past life to deserve this, but it must have been good! hahaha....haha...
§7-------------------
§8§:Is your life too good to be true; email me:
§7§nwitchmag@goodvibe.com
§0
