#- §5╔═.✵.════════╗    §2      ᴘʀᴏʟᴏɢᴜᴇ
§5╚════════.✵.═╝
§8𝒷𝑒 𝑔𝑒𝓃𝓊𝒾𝓃𝑒 𝓁𝒾𝓀𝑒 𝒻𝑒𝓇𝓃 𝒾𝓃 𝓉𝒽𝑒 𝒻𝑜𝓇𝓇𝑒𝓈𝓉 - 𝓈𝓌𝑒𝑒𝓉𝓅𝑒𝒶
§5-------------------
§2The mystical town of FERN is named after the timeless collection of Craftadian stories of a brave adventurer. Her story echoes through the deepest caves and 
#- §2whistles through the tallest trees. Some will believe them to be nothing but a myth, a fairy tale, some old folklore passed through generations. 

It is a long and forgotten history for those... wait, sorry, it's not forgotten at all, why did I write that? Ugh silly me *cough* 
#- §2Fern is a very well known Flower Maiden (like myself) who Craftadians admire and some even worship, like the town of FERN. Why did I feel the need to remind everyone about this? This is common knowledge! FACTS! This is no myth. Fern is as real as you or I. I am very old, I was there!
#- §2Don't let that fool you, I may be an old and wise witch, but I'm still in my prime as far as witches go. 
I'm desirable, I am a Sweetpea after all, that's why everyone falls in love with me. It's a blessing and a curse. But I can't help what my parents used to create me okay!?! That's not my fault. 
#- §2I'm rambling again.

Fern, yes Fern. I wish to tell you all about her and the amazing life she lived. She was created from a Fern by a super powerful witch named Marigold. Her mother loved her  so much §5ɨȶ §2nearly destoryed her. Huh? §5ɨȶ§2? §5ɨȶ.. ɨȶ ɨȶ ɨȶ ɨȶ...§2 what's going on?  
#- §2When I write §5'ɨȶ' ɨȶ§2 looks like §5ɨȶ. ɨȶ §2is so annoying! Why? How can I write my story if §5ɨȶ§2 looks like§5 ɨȶ. 

ɨȶ.. ɨȶ ɨȶ §2it... it... oh.. it
okay it's fine now.

I'll add that to the ever-growing list of paranormal anomalies. The CEO will be pleased. Where was I? 
#- §2When Fern was a young girl, she found an enchanted sword named The Soultrap. It was said to be some kind of prison for a vengeful spirit. She accidently let §5ɨȶ§2 free. LET IT FREE ugh...
Now that's the real myth here, the ghost with no name. Marigold told Fern to stop this entity because
#- §2The Order Of The Spyglass would be mad. Don't get me started on them. I used to be a member of that cult. Only briefly, because I found out they were a cult. Anyway, Fern fell in love with Castien Morlana, a mage prince. They defeated The Ender Dragon together!  
#- §2The Ender Dragon Azarla, such a beast. That was the most epic fight in the history of fights. And all because they wanted to get Castiens Emerald Crown back. 

Fern and Castien got married, it was such a wonderful day. I gave her a necklace. With a special enchantment
#- §2of my own making. The gift to link our minds together. I don't think it worked, I must have messed up somewhere.

Fern died as a great Queen, respected by all. 

Castien mysteriously vanished, poor Fern. Nobody knows why or how. Fern never said.
#- §2And that leaves us here. In the present day! But I still have so many tales I wish to tell about her life. My fasination with both Fern and Castien is part of the reason I'm so fasinated by all things... 'conspiracy'. One of the reasons I do what I do, now here on Deathcap. I NEED 
to know more! 
#- §2To be continued…
§5✿✿❀❀❀✿✿.✿✿❀❀❀✿✿

§2Tune in next time 
for more of... 
ꜰᴇʀɴ'ꜱ ᴀᴅᴠᴇɴᴛᴜʀᴇꜱ!

Read 'older' stories in 'other' issues! 
I'll explain OMG HOW!?! THIS IS SO COOL!!
