§cMet with the beauty of a green copper floor and blossom roof with falling leaves, snow all around you, the sky and stars, this place is amazing! 

Made my face go 
like this; ☉Ô☉
#- §cThe build is huge and high in the sky and a circle, so... clever.
It's got all the trims you could ever need. If you are like me and like trims, but don't know where to start or get them yourself, this place is perfect! 
I don't know what else this place will be but I had my eye on the event item display.§r
#- §cThey also have a car? A car! The whole build is taking shape so well, and I am shocked I did not know this existed until now. 

Good work so far Demi!§r

