  §8| §6)( §8|  §9Witching Hour!
  §8|§6(. .)§8|  §9------------
§8+====+ §9Ask A Witch?
-------------------
§3Welcome to the 1st ever Craftadia Advice Column! Here is what you do... Have any paranormal questions for the Deathcap Team? Send in your questions right here!§r 
#- §3Keep it simple, keep it of a 'supernatural' nature, we don't deal with normal human people problems. 
And I'll do my best to answer them and give you the best advice from the best witch in the business! 

Trust me, I know exactly what 
I am doing... I think.§r
#- §3So here we go...
§r
§9✉ Reader Yoshi:
-------------------
Why do I have dreams about another life where I take care of 3 young dragons?
-------------------§r
§3Oh dear, dream dilemmas! Well Yoshi, fear not, if you are dreaming about 3 cute little dragons then§r
#- §3I'd just roll with it. Embrace the madness! And be aware that you are not the only person who has reported dreams of past lives. Even I have had some strange ones, like one time, I saw a Giant Plant! So it's perfectly normal to have dreams when it feels so real it's scary o.o§r 
#- §9✉ Reader Dr. Link
-------------------
I think the Plague Frog's are plotting world domination. They keep staring at me with glowing eyes & making strategic moves. What do I do?
-------------------§r
§3Oh, the ol'froggie power play! Don't worry Dr. Link, they just need space.§r
#- §3Consider distracting them with a laser pointer or a shiny toy. Remember, in the battle between humans and frogs, resistance is futile. We're already under their control so don't fight it. Have you tried some treats and belly rubs. Don't go all 'science' on them and start dissecting one! DON'T!§r
#- §9✉ Reader MissPortinari (CEO)
-------------------
I found a journal whilst fishing in the river. It's in my own handwriting but I don't remember writing it. It talks about thing's I've never done, am I going crazy??
-------------------§r
§3(⚆ᗝ⚆) ummm...
okay... I'll email you!
